<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_彻底耗尽、熄灭、淘汰与消失 (Extinction, Exhaustion & Disappearance — '熄灭/绝迹')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 317 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>出去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exit, leave</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move out of or depart from<div class='ex-sent'>“leave the room”</div></td></tr>
