<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 11 个核心义项'>义项 1/11</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>去掉，扣除</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remove, cause</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to leave<div class='ex-sent'>“The teacher took the children out of the classroom”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 11 个核心义项'>义项 2/11</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拿出，取出，去掉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>unpack, remove</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> remove from its packing<div class='ex-sent'>“unpack the presents”</div></td></tr>
