<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 3/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>熄灭</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>end, stop</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become extinguished<div class='ex-sent'>“The lights suddenly went out and we were in the dark”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>all out</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进行，履行，完成</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>perform, task</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> perform a task as well as possible<div class='ex-sent'>“The cast gives full measure every night”</div></td></tr>
