<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 5/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>过时</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>change, fashion</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go out of fashion; become unfashionable<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to go out (go out of fashion).”</div></td></tr>
