<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_查明、算出、理解与甄别筛选 (Discovery, Solution & Selection — '水落石出/弄清')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 60 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>发展，使发达，进步</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>develop</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> come up with<div class='ex-sent'>“His colleagues worked out his interesting idea”</div></td></tr>
