<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>发生，恰巧，a. 确定的</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>happen</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> happen in a certain way, leading to, producing, or resulting in a certain outcome, often well<div class='ex-sent'>“Things worked out in an interesting way”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>作出</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>elaborate, develop</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> work out in detail<div class='ex-sent'>“elaborate a plan”</div></td></tr>
