<details class='sub-section' id='sub_4'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>05_完全展开、延伸、坚持到底与执行 (Expansion, Endurance & Execution — '铺开/彻底完成')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 62 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>carry <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进行，实现，执行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>implement, complete</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pursue to a conclusion or bring to a successful issue<div class='ex-sent'>“Did he go through with the treatment?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>carry <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进行，实现，执行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>accomplish, execute</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put in effect<div class='ex-sent'>“carry out a task”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>伸出，提出</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exsert, extend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> thrust or extend out<div class='ex-sent'>“He held out his hand”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 2/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>伸出，提出，提供</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>resist, withstand</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> stand up or offer resistance to somebody or something<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to hold out (stand up or offer resistance to somebody or something).”</div></td></tr>
